  "body": "A spacious residence with single-level style, beachside living, you'll love.\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern living and built to an exceptional standard, this beautifully appointed 209sqm freehold townhouse combines generous proportions with refined comfort in Long Bay's sought-after beachside community. \r\n\r\nFrom growing families to busy professionals, active retirees, frequent travellers and those simply wanting more time to enjoy life, this is a home that adapts beautifully to every stage.\r\n\r\nThe thoughtfully designed layout features four generous bedrooms, two separate living areas, a study nook, tandem internal-access garaging and the rare addition of a private elevator, making everyday living as comfortable today as it will be for years to come. Ducted air conditioning and heated bathroom floors provide year-round comfort, while the luxurious master suite enjoys abundant natural light, a walk-through wardrobe and an elegant ensuite.\r\n\r\nThe entire lower level has been devoted to spacious open-plan living and entertaining, creating an inviting hub where family and friends naturally gather. Whether it's summer barbecues, relaxed evenings with neighbours or celebrations that continue long after sunset, the indoor and outdoor living spaces have been designed to bring people together.\r\n\r\nBeyond your front door lies the lifestyle that has made Long Bay one of Auckland's most desirable coastal communities. Enjoy morning walks along the beach, weekends exploring nearby parks and coastal tracks, excellent cafés, quality schools and a welcoming neighbourhood where a genuine sense of community still thrives. With convenient access to the Northern Busway, the CBD and northern holiday destinations are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nFor those who love to travel, the secure lock-and-leave design and low-maintenance grounds provide the freedom to head away with confidence, knowing your home will be waiting as you left it.\r\n\r\nThis quality build, by well-respected, local developer carries a Master Build Guarantee, available for transfer at purchaser's cost. \r\n\r\nBeautifully presented, exceptionally versatile and positioned for an outstanding lifestyle, this is a home that deserves your inspection.\r\n\r\n\r\nContact Shane or Jen today to arrange your viewing.",
